This code initializes the pigpio library, configures the ADS1115 to read single-ended on AIN0 (pressure signal) and AIN1 (NTC temperature signal) at a gain of 2/3 (FSR ±6.144V), 128 SPS, and reads the pressure and temperature data. It then calculates the pressure and temperature values using linear transfer functions and displays them on the console. The code also checks if the pressure exceeds a warning threshold of 105.0 kPa and drives a warning LED on GPIO17 (active-high) HIGH if it does. The code runs in an infinite loop until it is interrupted by a SIGINT signal, at which point it cleans up the resources and exits.

