This code initializes pigpio, sets up SPI and ADC, maps the ADC value to a rainfall intensity level, logs the reading, and cleans up on exit. It uses the `itimer` to sample the ADC value once per second. If an error occurs during SPI or ADC operations, it prints an error message and continues with the next iteration. If the program is interrupted with `SIGINT`, it closes the SPI handle and terminates pigpio.

