This code initializes libgpiod, opens the chip and line for GPIO17, requests the line and LED pin, and reads the sensor value. If the sensor value is 0 (i.e., the sound level exceeds the threshold), it blinks the LED for 1 second. The program prints the sensor value to the console each iteration and exits cleanly when the program is interrupted with SIGINT or SIGTERM.

