This code initializes pigpio, opens an I2C handle, configures the VL53L1X timing budget and ranging, starts ranging, and enters an infinite loop where it polls the sensor, checks the distance, and logs the open/close events. It also handles sensor-absent or bus-error paths and cleans up resources on exit.

