This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up the I2C bus, and configures the MPR121 sensor. It then enters a loop where it continuously reads the sensor status and turns on an LED connected to GPIO 27 when proximity is detected. The LED is turned off after 1 second. The code also handles errors and releases all resources when the program exits.

