This code uses the pigpio library to read temperature and humidity from a Sensirion SHT35-DIS-B sensor connected to I2C bus 1 at address 0x44. It sends the single-shot high-repeatability command (0x2400), waits for 15 ms, reads 6 bytes, validates the CRC-8 checksums, converts the raw values, logs the reading to a CSV file named 'environment.csv', and repeats the process every 5 seconds. The code also handles errors and cleans up resources on all exit paths.

