This code uses the libgpiod library to poll a KY-026 Flame Sensor connected to GPIO 20 every 100 milliseconds. It logs the state transitions (flame detected / flame cleared) with ISO 8601 UTC timestamps to 'flame_log.txt'. The code includes robust error handling for libgpiod and file I/O calls, and ensures clean resource release on all exit paths. It also implements graceful shutdown via SIGINT/SIGTERM signal handling.

