This code uses the libgpiod API to monitor the digital output of two TI DRV5032 digital Hall-Effect sensors connected to GPIO17 and GPIO27. It logs the sensor states to a file named 'conveyor_log.txt' every 50 ms, and if both sensors read logic 1 (triggered), it prints a message indicating that the conveyor has been halted. The code also handles errors for GPIO access, log file I/O, and libgpiod resources, and releases all resources cleanly on all exit paths.

