This code uses the pigpio library to read the state of the two GPIO pins and trigger an alert when both pins are HIGH for a continuous duration of at least 500 milliseconds. It also logs each seismic event to a file with an ISO-8601-style timestamp. The program runs indefinitely until interrupted by a SIGINT or SIGTERM signal.

