```

This code initializes pigpio, opens a log file, seeds the random number generator, and enters an infinite loop where it reads moisture sensor readings, logs the readings and relay states, updates the relay states, sets the relay states, and sleeps for 5 seconds. If an error occurs, it deactivates all relays, closes the log file, and terminates pigpio. The log file is opened in append mode, so each new log entry is appended to the end of the file. The relays are active-low, so a reading below 30 activates the relay, and a reading above 30 deactivates it.

