This code uses the pigpio library to monitor a PIR motion sensor on GPIO 4 and activate a relay-controlled 12V LED floodlight on GPIO 17 when motion is detected. It logs every activation event with an ISO-8601 timestamp and every deactivation event with timestamp and measured duration in seconds to `security_log.txt` in append mode. The code also handles errors, releases resources on all exit paths, and uses a signal handler to cleanly turn off the floodlight when Ctrl+C is pressed.

