This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up the flow sensor and solenoid valve, and runs a main thread that samples the flow sensor every second, computes the flow rate, and logs the results. The solenoid valve is controlled based on the flow rate, and the log file is opened and closed as required. The program also handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals by logging the event, reopening the solenoid to its safe state, closing the log file, destroying the mutex, and calling gpioTerminate.

